*.ckpt binary
*.onnx binary
*.index binary
*.pt binary
*.bin binary
*.safetensors binary
*.wav binary
*.mp3 binary
*.flac binary
*.mp4 binary
*.mov binary
*.mkv binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
